      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "FYI, I attach the detailed log of trying to play a nicovideo.jp video on VRChat, and the log of trying to download it on yt-dlp (2023.06.22) which is not for VRChat.\n\n(yt-dlp for VRChat only outputs an \"Unknown\" error and \"Object reference not set to an instance of an object\" exception on VRChat, and exits with code 0. The `-g` and `--get-format` options work the same as non-VRC version.)\n\n```\n\n2023.08.03 14:25:49 Log        -  [Video Playback] Attempting to resolve URL 'https://www.nicovideo.jp/watch/sm39411572'\n\n2023.08.03 14:25:49 Log        -  NativeProcess.Start: started process id [1232]: C:/Users/Sayamame/AppData/LocalLow/VRChat/VRChat\\Tools/yt-dlp.exe (...)\n\n2023.08.03 14:25:50 Log        -  NativeProcess.HasExited: process exited with code 0, took 1122 ms. Command line: C:/Users/Sayamame/AppData/LocalLow/VRChat/VRChat\\Tools/yt-dlp.exe (...)\n\n2023.08.03 14:25:50 Exception  -  Object reference not set to an instance of an object.\n\n  at ÌÍÍÌÍÌÍÌÏÏÌÌÏÏÍÏÍÎÍÏÍÎÎ+ÍÏÍÍÏÏÍÌÏÎÏÍÌÏÌÏÍÎÍÎÌÍÍ.ÍÏÏÍÍÏÌÎÎÏÌÏÎÍÏÍÍÏÎÎÏÍÎ (System.Collections.Generic.List`1[T] ÏÎÌÌÏÍÍÏÌÌÌÍÍÍÍÌÎÎÎÌÍÍÍ) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n  at System.Action`1[T].Invoke (T obj) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n  at ÌÍÍÌÍÌÍÌÏÏÌÌÏÏÍÏÍÎÍÏÍÎÎ+ÎÌÌÌÏÌÍÎÍÎÍÍÏÎÎÍÏÎÍÍÏÍÎ.MoveNext () [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n  at UnityEngine.SetupCoroutine.InvokeMoveNext (System.Collections.IEnumerator enumerator, System.IntPtr returnValueAddress) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0\n\n```\n\nyt-dlp log: https://gist.github.com/Sayamame-beans/85ac0150bc513932ab0935bf17af58fb",
